collectively known as the Nuremberg Race Laws.\",\"url\":\"https://encyclopedia.ushmm.org/content/en/article/nuremberg-laws\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"227\",\"title\":\"Anti-Jewish Legislation - Holocaust Museum Houston\",\"description\":\"When the Nazis came into power in 1933, they immediately passed legislation that discriminated against Germany's Jewish population. With these laws, Nazis.Missing:  hygiene | Show results with:hygiene\",\"url\":\"https://hmh.org/library/research/anti-jewish-legislation-research-guide/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"228\",\"title\":\"The Impact of the Nuremberg Laws: Discovering Jewish Blood\",\"description\":\"Aug 2, 2016 · The Nuremberg Laws turned Jews from German citizens into “residents of Germany.” Technically, the law made intermarriage between Jews and German citizens a ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.facinghistory.org/resource-library/discovering-jewish-blood\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"229\",\"title\":\"Einsatzgruppen: An Overview - Holocaust Encyclopedia\",\"description\":\"Einsatzgruppen, often called “mobile killing units,” are best known for their role in the murder of Jews in mass shooting operations during the Holocaust.\",\"url\":\"https://encyclopedia.ushmm.org/content/en/article/einsatzgruppen\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"230\",\"title\":\"Otto Ohlendorf, Einsatzgruppe D, and the 'Holocaust by Bullets'\",\"description\":\"Jan 13, 2021 · As the leader of Einsatzgruppe D, Otto Ohlendorf was responsible for the murder of 90000 Soviet Jews, Roma, and Communists.\",\"url\":\"https://www.nationalww2museum.org/war/articles/otto-ohlendorf-holocaust\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"231\",\"title\":\"\\\"Final Solution\\\": In Depth | Holocaust Encyclopedia\",\"description\":\"Dec 8, 2020 · The \\\"Final Solution,\\\" the Nazi plan to kill the Jews of Europe, was a core goal of Adolf Hitler and the culmination of German policy under ...\",\"url\":\"https://encyclopedia.ushmm.org/content/en/article/final-solution-in-depth\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"232\",\"title\":\"\\\"Final Solution\\\": Overview - Holocaust Encyclopedia\",\"description\":\"Dec 8, 2020 · The term Final Solution to the Jewish Question was a euphemism used by Nazi Germany's leaders. It referred to the mass murder of Europe's ...\",\"url\":\"https://encyclopedia.ushmm.org/content/en/article/final-solution-overview\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"233\",\"title\":\"The Final Solution / Before the extermination / History / Auschwitz ...\",\"description\":\"It was probably at the end of March or in April 1942 that the Germans began killing sick prisoners and Jews in a provisional gas chamber in Birkenau.\",\"url\":\"https://www.auschwitz.org/en/history/before-the-extermination/the-final-solution\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"234\",\"title\":\"[PDF] Einsatzgruppen | Yad Vashem\",\"description\":\"As Germany prepared to invade the Soviet Union in June 1941, Hitler made it clear to the army that the upcoming war was based on a fundamental conflict between ...\",\"url\":\"https://wwv.yadvashem.org/yv/pdf-drupal/Einsatzgruppen.pdf\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"235\",\"title\":\"Wannsee Conference and the \\\"Final Solution\\\"\",\"description\":\"The Wannsee Conference was a high-level meeting of German officials to discuss and implement the so-called “Final Solution of the Jewish Question” (mass ...\",\"url\":\"https://encyclopedia.ushmm.org/content/en/article/wannsee-conference-and-the-final-solution\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"236\",\"title\":\"[PDF] We Will Never Speak of It: Evidence of Hitler's Direct Responsibility ...\",\"description\":\"Further evidence of the Nazi effort to hide the Final Solution as seen in a speech by Himmler to a meeting of SS Generals in Poznan, Poland on October 4, 1943: ...\",\"url\":\"https://digitalcommons.iwu.edu/cgi/viewcontent.cgi?article=1170\u0026context=constructing\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"237\",\"title\":\"The Wannsee Conference - Yad Vashem\",\"description\":\"As a result, a network of extermination camps was established in which 1.7 million Jews were murdered in 1942-1943.\",\"url\":\"https://www.yadvashem.org/holocaust/about/final-solution-beginning/wannsee-conference.html\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"238\",\"title\":\"Mass Shootings of Jews during the Holocaust\",\"description\":\"Aug 31, 2021 · These murders were part of the “Final Solution to the Jewish Question,” the mass murder of Europe's Jews. Key Facts. 1. The Nazi German regime ...\",\"url\":\"https://encyclopedia.ushmm.org/content/en/article/mass-shootings-of-jews-during-the-holocaust\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"239\",\"title\":\"The Einsatzgruppen and the Holocaust \\\" by Lauren R. Letizia\",\"description\":\"These units were responsible for murdering over two million Jews from 1941 to 1944, primarily through mass shootings.\",\"url\":\"https://cupola.gettysburg.edu/student_scholarship/1062/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"240\",\"title\":\"Protocol of the Wannsee Conference, January 20, 1942 - Yad Vashem\",\"description\":\"Reich Secret Document30 CopiesProtocol of ConferenceI. The following took part in the conference on the final solution (Endloesung) of the Jewish question ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.yadvashem.org/docs/wannsee-conference-protocol.html\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"241\",\"title\":\"Holocaust Facts: Where Does the Figure of 6 Million Victims Come ...\",\"description\":\"Jan 27, 2022 · One of the most well-known, if not iconic, facts known about the Holocaust is the number of Jewish victims killed by Nazi Germany up through the ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.haaretz.com/israel-news/2022-01-27/ty-article/6-million-where-is-the-figure-from/0000017f-da74-dea8-a77f-de761f480000\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"242\",\"title\":\"Quantifying the Holocaust: Hyperintense kill rates during the Nazi ...\",\"description\":\"Jan 2, 2019 · ... death camps [Kr(Holocaust) = 445,700 murders per month]. The ... On the death toll of Jewish victims of Nazi crimes, in Denial of the ...\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6314819/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"243\",\"title\":\"How Many People did the Nazis Murder? | Holocaust Encyclopedia\",\"description\":\"Sep 26, 2023 · Adolf Hitler and the Nazi Rise to Power, 1918–1933 · Euthanasia ... Breakdown and explanation of how six million Jewish people were murdered in ...Missing:  responsibility | Show results with:responsibility\",\"url\":\"https://encyclopedia.ushmm.org/content/en/article/documenting-numbers-of-victims-of-the-holocaust-and-nazi-persecution\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"244\",\"title\":\"The Beginning of the Final Solution - Yad Vashem\",\"description\":\"The mass murder of the Jews began with the German invasion of the Soviet Union on June 22, 1941. By the end of 1941 80% of Lithuanian Jewry had been murdered.\",\"url\":\"https://www.yadvashem.org/holocaust/about/final-solution-beginning.html\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"245\",\"title\":\"\\\"We Will Never Speak of It: Evidence of Hitler's Direct Responsibility ...\",\"description\":\"The “Intentionalist vs. Functionalist” debate has raged amongst academic historians for decades, centered on the question of whether Adolf Hitler personally ...Missing:  authorization | Show results with:authorization\",\"url\":\"https://digitalcommons.iwu.edu/constructing/vol13/iss1/7/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"246\",\"title\":\"[PDF] Perspective on the Intentionalist/Functionalist Debate on Nazi ...\",\"description\":\"Abstract: This article aims to examine the nuances of both the. Intentionalist and Functionalist perspectives as they relate to Nazi.\",\"url\":\"https://scholarworks.lib.csusb.edu/cgi/viewcontent.cgi?article=1115\u0026context=history-in-the-making\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"247\",\"title\":\"Intentionalist vs Functionalist | The Holocaust | UKEssays.com\",\"description\":\"Jun 14, 2016 · Functionalist historians include Ian Kershaw, Christopher Browning, and Hans Mommsen. Unlike intentionalists who believe the Holocaust ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.ukessays.com/essays/history/the-functionalist-vs-intentionalist-debate.php\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"248\",\"title\":\"Coordinating the Destruction of an Entire People: The Wannsee ...\",\"description\":\"Jan 19, 2021 · On January 20, 1942, a group of Nazi leaders met to coordinate a continent-wide genocide.\",\"url\":\"https://www.nationalww2museum.org/war/articles/wannsee-conference-1942\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"249\",\"title\":\"[PDF] Interpretations of the Holocaust\",\"description\":\"The argument between intentionalists and functionalists has created interesting controversies that have excited and challenged historians over many decades. The ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.holocaustcentre.org.nz/uploads/1/1/5/2/115245341/interpretations-of-the-holocaust.pdf\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"250\",\"title\":\"History - World Wars: Hitler's Leadership Style - BBC\",\"description\":\"Mar 30, 2011 · Hitler was, first and foremost, determined to command personally. According to his so-called Leader Principle (Führerprinzip), ultimate authority rested with ...Führerprinzip · Headquarters · Hitler's distrust of his generals · Reliance on instinct\",\"url\":\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/history/worldwars/wwtwo/hitler_commander_01.shtml\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"251\",\"title\":\"Working Toward the Führer - Facing History\",\"description\":\"Aug 2, 2016 · Hitler used the title Führer to refer to his position within the Nazi Party. Führer means “leader,” but to Hitler the Führer was not an ordinary leader.Missing:  NSDAP | Show results with:NSDAP\",\"url\":\"https://www.facinghistory.org/resource-library/working-toward-fuhrer\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"252\",\"title\":\"A Psychological Analysis of Adolf Hitler's Decision Making as ...\",\"description\":\"Hitler hesitated when making important decisions, then abruptly made a decision without considering its premises critically or comprehensively. Illusionary ...\",\"url\":\"h