k, Dr Theodor Morell, to dose him with ...\",\"url\":\"https://theprint.in/pageturner/excerpt/hitler-had-chronic-flatulence-took-medicine-made-from-faeces-healthy-german-soldiers/2329207/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"290\",\"title\":\"Adolf Hitler's Parkinson's disease and an attempt to analyse his ...\",\"description\":\"It has been proved that Adolf Hitler suffered from idiopathic Parkinson's disease. No indication for postencephalitic parkinsonism was found in the clinical ...\",\"url\":\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/10053222/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"291\",\"title\":\"Hitler's parkinsonism\",\"description\":\"Here, the authors discuss Hitler's parkinsonism in the context of the Third Reich and its eventual destruction, maintaining that ultimately his disease had ...\",\"url\":\"https://thejns.org/focus/view/journals/neurosurg-focus/39/1/article-pE8.pdf\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"292\",\"title\":\"Might Adolf Hitler's Gut Problems Have Been Parkinson-Related?\",\"description\":\"Specifically, we posit the hypothesis that Hitler may have suffered from small-intestinal bacterial overgrowth (SIBO), thus providing an early example of SIBO ...\",\"url\":\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/36921591/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"293\",\"title\":\"Dr. Theodor Morell And The Untold Truth About Hitler's Drug Habit\",\"description\":\"Apr 2, 2018 · According to Morell's notes, Hitler received a total of 800 injections and varying medications 1,100 times between August of 1941 to April of ...\u003c|control11|\u003e\u003c|separator|\u003e\",\"url\":\"https://allthatsinteresting.com/theodor-morell\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"294\",\"title\":\"Hitler Was 'Blitzed' on Cocaine And Opiates During The War, Author ...\",\"description\":\"Mar 7, 2017 · Morell was famous for giving vitamin injections, and Hitler, with his healthy diet, immediately believed in this doctor and got daily vitamin ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.npr.org/sections/health-shots/2017/03/07/518986612/author-says-hitler-was-blitzed-on-cocaine-and-opiates-during-the-war\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"295\",\"title\":\"A Long Bad Trip | The National WWII Museum | New Orleans\",\"description\":\"Jul 18, 2017 · Equally well known is Hitler's reliance on a personal physician—a quack, actually—named Theodor Morell, who provided the Führer with injections ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.nationalww2museum.org/war/articles/long-bad-trip\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"296\",\"title\":\"Was Hitler a Christian? - Christian Research Institute\",\"description\":\"Apr 4, 2015 · Table Talk includes statements by Hitler that are overtly hostile to Christianity. But while Table Talk may contain some authentic reminisces ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.equip.org/articles/was-hitler-a-christian/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"297\",\"title\":\"Hitler: Atheist, Pagan or Christian?\",\"description\":\"Jul 14, 2021 · 185-211, p. 208). Ultimately, Steigmann-Gall believes that the “Table Talk” documents support the idea that Hitler was anti-Christian, though ...\",\"url\":\"https://historyforatheists.com/2021/07/hitler-atheist-pagan-or-christian/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"298\",\"title\":\"Adolf Hitler: Excerpts from Mein Kampf - Jewish Virtual Library\",\"description\":\"Hitler outlines his political ideology and future plans for Germany. We include these excerpts to offer an insight into his thinking and expressions of anti- ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.jewishvirtuallibrary.org/excerpts-from-mein-kampf\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"299\",\"title\":\"Nazi Party Platform | Holocaust Encyclopedia\",\"description\":\"Jun 27, 2025 · Adolf Hitler helped write the program and presented it at a meeting in a German beer hall on February 24, 1920. Key Facts. 1. The Nazi Party ...\",\"url\":\"https://encyclopedia.ushmm.org/content/en/article/nazi-party-platform\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"300\",\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://nuremberg.law.harvard.edu/documents/1506-extracts-from-a